- Rebuilt fn-css.js from the last valid version and inserted the horizontal layout rules before the CSS template's closing backtick, keeping the entire stylesheet inside FNX.CSS.
- Preserved the existing content.js changes and all icons/assets; this repair does not add new behavior beyond making the prior CSS load correctly.
- Workspace: Changes/fix-broken-horizontal-overlay/fix-broken-horizontal-overlay/.

